00:02:53,925 --> 00:02:57,247
we also need enough RAM or video RAM,

67
00:02:57,471 --> 00:02:58,242
preferably.

68
00:02:58,819 --> 00:03:02,013
Now, video RAM is the memory that's directly

69
00:03:02,029 --> 00:03:04,933
attached to the GPU. So if we have a GPU, we

